msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫M-⟪k:2⟫Maria, s-⟪k:3⟫sua—!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FA1A1781_60CF_4F37_8D9A_EC0F60D4AF49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7328b5affabce2f24b7bda04c654e17420a767f2081aa62d4efa6516cc0a3ebf
#. default-sha256: 7cefa59e0706475b35f9f6b494d713b26b64ae81570de822b0ad3c8d8ac17461
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FA1A1781_60CF_4F37_8D9A_EC0F60D4AF49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“My god, are you men or ⟪k:2⟫children⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫This is ⟪k:6⟫my⟪k:7⟫ house, and I "
"would rather you didn’t talk about it like that.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Meu Deus, vocês são homens ou ⟪k:2⟫crianças⟪k:3⟫?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Esta é ⟪k:6⟫minha⟪k:7⟫ "
"casa, e eu preferiria que vocês não falassem essas coisas dela.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9CF3B6A0_6F14_4E4D_A941_D81DE587C202
