msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫...⟪k:2⟫...⟪k:3⟫...⟪k:4⟫...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫So.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"Did you come here for the sole purpose of telling me that cheap tripe?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫...⟪k:2⟫...⟪k:3⟫...⟪k:4⟫...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Então.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫"
"Você veio aqui com o único propósito de me contar essa tolice barata?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D165466E_04A8_429A_AC1F_CC190883006D
