#: scenario3:scenario3_A4E6FCF4_294C_4F4B_A592_B044693D09DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24d7eba4b254ae2de6883d73ded9bd46ae7760bfcea4f03dcc32d9fe49097050
