msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, I mean, I ⟪k:2⟫did⟪k:3⟫ make up a good half of it,⟪k:4⟫but the maid really did "
"hear a sound in the middle of the night."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bem, quero dizer, eu ⟪k:2⟫realmente⟪k:3⟫ inventei metade daquilo,⟪k:4⟫mas a criada "
"ouviu mesmo um som no meio da noite."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5d11a65652364e7ca0756234a4bc96089290c4754a8fb9849ac4f1f63c033b7
#. default-sha256: 8eafa9fe761f3e24770bcff48783ea61898d173a1c6b78ac4a84903ad1c097d8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79A15F8D_75C8_486C_94EA_123192FF01A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it came from the back hall of this very mansion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didja know, they say it used "
"to be a chapel?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E veio do salão dos fundos desta mansão.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você sabia, dizem que era uma capela?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd939487a07b0af84e646c5bbcba95c3203ce38572dfbf4f4651a293bc75e088
#. default-sha256: 1cd5153d3c56955af89c2eea3cc076c26f42ebd5c09bab6e3f03d5eda918629e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D94ECB6_FD6C_4BB6_9262_5446370A58B1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Again, I have no interest in you women’s little ghost stories."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais uma vez, não tenho interesse nas historinhas de fantasma de vocês mulheres."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B689A9F5_9980_449B_8F17_4B428117F228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bc1a31bbe4c07d3eca5e882609b5f78f463ab0041eb5b4e642128b79be1ed73
