msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria!⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria!⟪k:3⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faa162c58bca624369ffd1a48fbb2abcc98958ae9a1839c2e043fff903285a25
#. default-sha256: 85f60f6436e3b11b2962db2ed0fabd000f2c752aafff2e84c12b4a615b455087
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_420D736B_63E1_46ED_B0B1_C92E330BE4DE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, that said, the rumors aren’t completely unfounded.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This ⟪k:4⟫is⟪k:5⟫ a "
"pretty old mansion, and it’s had a lot of work done on it.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Kinda feels like it’s barely "
"holding itself together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bem, dito isso, os rumores não são completamente infundados.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Esta ⟪k:4⟫é⟪k:5⟫ "
"uma mansão bem antiga, e passou por muitas reformas.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Dá a impressão que mal consegue se "
"manter de pé."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc35038072c4f3c659f48dfa43c7fbcf6ff4d80b340b294951bc40cb25e97c83
#. default-sha256: 51b684eef39e014780b63953bb736286573a36e22622861d15270529bbc399bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8A81ED2_FE20_44FE_B1D8_A91774CCA311"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Like a big old quilt with pieces from all different time periods."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Como uma grande colcha velha com peças de diferentes épocas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92d330f4814806a81f1ebb514ecce24477dfc0a4e738ec69f1d3bba94965dfb0
#. default-sha256: 9d569e9d52d4c67e1d4bc1ab747229735af2de995e86e9f34e317f80049b0b1a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC18B130_44EE_431A_88F6_029BB85BA802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The back hall is one of the oldest patches.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s a huge window on the far "
"end, and supposedly, there used to be stained glass in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O salão dos fundos é um dos trechos mais antigos.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Há uma janela enorme na "
"extremidade e, supostamente, costumava ter vitrais nela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2743dbd5413a02b3f3946d462140e4b68a2a25cf22466cd3e6eca73944305efc
#. default-sha256: c8a7f39a7a067c556b6441298541956f7622b9a1ffb6ee0afa801496cab16ee9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_03B616D1_F5BD_4EB4_93EA_963BCFEED59B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a depiction of an archangel, they say.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a shame. I wonder when it was "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dizem que era a representação de um arcanjo.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Que pena. Eu me pergunto quando foi "
"quebrada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2e7ffbae92f0006d3cb0c39939d3c3c0b74a35551fe70d67515acf637f4adf8
#. default-sha256: a55f5027bc2731e5a1b1cd95f5b6ac01e4951ac45fa5b0358410849da0235932
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F386BA1D_CBE5_4CC4_8FA1_7CFD890B7DE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If it were still there, I bet it’d be worth a fortune!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se ainda estivesse lá, aposto que valeria uma fortuna!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_959EFDB9_6DA3_4394_976F_ABA1BD83F487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9341646d651a14447ff512d1147529045791983bface78a26a9c26e4bf83ed3b
